WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.720
Hi, I'm JR.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.990
Let's get Grok ready on your computer.

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.950
Open your web browser and go to grok dot com.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.510
There's nothing to download.

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:12.130
Tap Sign up, or Sign in if you already have an account,

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:15.800
and use your email, Google, or your X account.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.880
You only ever type your password on Grok's own page,

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:20.949
so never give it to anyone.

